WEBVTT

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.984
and drag stuff out of the ground

00:07:31.008 --> 00:07:33.897
and get things hot
and poison and pollute ...

00:07:33.921 --> 00:07:36.142
But I got this hard thing!"

00:07:36.804 --> 00:07:37.954
(Laughter)

00:07:37.978 --> 00:07:39.577
"I'm so clever!"

00:07:39.601 --> 00:07:42.646
And you look behind you,
and there's destruction all around you.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:43.823
But guess what?

00:07:43.847 --> 00:07:46.393
You're so clever,
but you're not as clever as a clam.

00:07:46.704 --> 00:07:47.941
A clamshell is hard.

00:07:48.458 --> 00:07:51.129
There's no vacuums.
There's no big furnaces.

00:07:51.153 --> 00:07:53.093
There's no poison. There's no pollution.

00:07:53.117 --> 00:07:57.917
It turns out that other species
figured out a long time ago

00:07:57.941 --> 00:08:00.276
how to create many of the things we need